{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-al-waha-2","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"al-waha-residences-expo-city","about":"Following the remarkable success of Al Waha 1, Expo City proudly unveils Al Waha 2 – an exclusive residential community crafted for elevated living. Nestled in the heart of Expo City Dubai, this boutique development features low-rise G+2 buildings housing just 284 thoughtfully designed residences. Offering a mix of 1 and 2-bedroom apartments, as well as stylish 2-bedroom lofts, Al Waha 2 invites residents to embrace a lifestyle defined by space, light, and seamless indoor-outdoor living.Each residence at Al Waha 2 benefits from generous layouts and free terraces, with corner units boasting up to 270° panoramic views. Lofts are distinguished by soaring ceilings reaching up to 6 meters, enhancing the sense of openness and sophistication. With a flexible 50/50 payment plan and a minimal 10% down payment, this development offers an accessible entry into an exclusive community enriched by lush landscaped parks, private courtyards, and wellness-focused amenities.","price":1880000,"title":"Al Waha 2","bitrix":{"id":1114,"pf_id":"are.2.15038","source":null,"project_id":"Al Waha Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Al Waha","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Expo City","project_location":"Expo City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Al_Waha_Residences_at_Expo_City_Dubai_efddb60261.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Al_Waha_Residences_at_Expo_City_Dubai_efddb60261.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":24.9627764,"lng":55.1584318},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Al_Waha_Residences_at_Expo_City_Dubai_83675d7ee9.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Al_Waha_Residences_at_Expo_City_Dubai_83675d7ee9